Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.37,0:02:21.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你竟然还住在这儿\N{\rEng}I cannot believe you still live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 你每次都这么说\N{\rEng}Yeah, well, you say that every time.
