Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.74,0:02:42.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:44.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 我是这么想的 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- This is what I think. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,跟男人做爱的时候...\N{\rEng}When you are having sex with a guy...
