Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 到底啥意思\N{\rEng}Mhmm. What is that, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:01.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Right.
