Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那我什么时候能看？\N{\rEng}So, are you gonna let me read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别急 还没好呢\N{\rEng}Yeah. But it's not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:25.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,连正式稿都算不上\N{\rEng}It's not even a proper draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但总归是个稿子\N{\rEng}But it's a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.54,0:04:27.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\rEng}It's definitely a draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还是那种纽约同性恋题材吗？\N{\rEng}Is it still about gay New York stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:33.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 不过这次更黑暗 偏心理化 也很幽默\N{\rEng}Yeah, but now it's, like, dark and like psychological, but also funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:35.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我绝对要看\N{\rEng}I will need to read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:38.09,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,啊嗨！\N{\rEng}Ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:39.53,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,他在跟我们说话吗？\N{\rEng}Is that guy talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:41.51,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,呃 他好像喊了句"啊嗨"\N{\rEng}Ugh, I think he just said, "Ahoy."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:44.42,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,啊嗨 邻居！\N{\rEng}Ahoy there, neighbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:46.08,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,啊嗨！\N{\rEng}Ahoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,唉 他占了我们的树\N{\rEng}Ugh, he's in our spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:49.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天杀的\N{\rEng}Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:05:00.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真想你还住在这儿\N{\rEng}I wish you still lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:01.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:05.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哪怕住近点\N{\rEng}Or closer, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 我也想你搬去我那\N{\rEng}Yeah, I wish you lived closer to me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我还是喜欢这儿\N{\rEng}I like it here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:13.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\rEng}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,压力很大 对吧？\N{\rEng}It's a lot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,待在这里的话\N{\rEng}Still being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪儿都不轻松\N{\rEng}Well, it's a lot to be wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.19,0:05:30.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 的确\N{\rEng}Yeah. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,研究生院真让人\N{\rEng}School was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 呃 让人作呕 - 呃\N{\rEng}- Ugh, Grad school was... - Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:37.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rEng}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:50.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你结完婚还会想我吗？\N{\rEng}Do you miss me even though you're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:54.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,会呀 即便结了婚 还是会想你啊\N{\rEng}Yes, I miss you even though I'm married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:55.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都结婚了\N{\rEng}Married.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 哎 - 都变成大人了\N{\rEng}- Ugh. - So grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:01.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真变成大人了\N{\rEng}It's so grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.03,0:06:04.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 那边的\N{\rEng}Hey! Hey, you over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:05.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我结婚了\N{\rEng}I'm married!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:08.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,刚领过证了\N{\rEng}I'm in a union that the state knows about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:10.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我爸离婚了\N{\rEng}My dad is divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:12.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 真惨\N{\rEng}Oh, that's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\rEng}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那么 我们现在怎么办？\N{\rEng}{\i1}Well, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就你一人了\N{\rEng}{\i1}You're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:23.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不管\N{\rEng}{\i1}I don't care whether I'm alone or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:24.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我的权利\N{\rEng}{\i1}It's my right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 是你的权利\N{\rEng}{\i1}It's your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:33.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你们想咋样 我就认定他有罪\N{\rEng}{\i1}What do you want? I say he's guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,讲讲你的理由\N{\rEng}{\i1}I wanna hear your arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.07,0:06:37.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我说过我...\N{\rEng}{\i1}I gave you my...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:54.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\rEng}Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\rEng}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:07.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,咦\N{\rEng}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\rEng}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:11.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 有事吗？ - 呃 没 抱歉\N{\rEng}- Can I help you? - Uh, no. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.77,0:07:13.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我敲错门了吗？\N{\rEng}Do I have the wrong house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是这户没错啊\N{\rEng}No. This is the right house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.03,0:07:17.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你是... - 等下\N{\rEng}- Are you... - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:18.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,完了 完了\N{\rEng}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 别 别 别\N{\rEng}Oh, no. no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就是这门啊\N{\rEng}This is the house, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你找安尼丝吗？ - 对 是\N{\rEng}- Are you looking for Agnes? - Yes, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:23.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文\N{\rEng}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:26.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你好呀 安尼丝 - 我是利迪\N{\rEng}- Agnes. - Lydie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:28.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 你就是利迪 真尴尬\N{\rEng}Oh, you're Lydie. Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:31.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉 因为周末又到了\N{\rEng}Okay, I am so sorry, this is the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:32.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:34.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我错了\N{\rEng}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:36.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没事 盖文是我邻居\N{\rEng}No problem. Gavin is my neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:40.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文 别忘了你住那边\N{\rEng}Gavin, you actually live over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 对 我住那边\N{\rEng}Oh, yes. I live there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 敲错了 - 没关系\N{\rEng}- Oops. - That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:46.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,做个好梦吧 盖文\N{\rEng}Sweet dreams, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:49.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,愿上帝管管你这可怜的灵魂 拜拜\N{\rEng}God bless your lost soul, and have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 利迪 - 我也是\N{\rEng}- It's nice to meet you, Lydie. - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.77,0:07:54.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他真可爱\N{\rEng}He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 他？- 你找他来上床的\N{\rEng}- Who? - You're fucking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:56.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 才没有\N{\rEng}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 把邻居找来上床的 - 不 没这事儿\N{\rEng}- You're fucking your neighbor. - No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你想和邻居盖文上床\N{\rEng}You're fucking your neighbor named Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:02.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是你想吧\N{\rEng}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:04.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是 才不是\N{\rEng}I'm not. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:07.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 那我也没 - 你就是想\N{\rEng}- No. I'm not. - You are fucking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:09.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 才不想 - 你就是想和他上床\N{\rEng}- I'm not. - You're fucking Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 安尼丝 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Agnes. - Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:43.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我得跟你说件事\N{\rEng}I need to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.99,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 是关于我身体的事\N{\rEng}Okay. So it's about my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:50.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 你身材很棒\N{\rEng}Oh, your body is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:51.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢\N{\rEng}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:54.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但 呃 我不是那个意思\N{\rEng}But, um, I didn't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:09:01.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我肚子里有个宝宝\N{\rEng}So I have a baby in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:05.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 怀了？ - 是啊\N{\rEng}- You do? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:07.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？现在就怀了吗？\N{\rEng}What? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:08.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\rEng}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 真假的\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐 你的身体真是个奇迹\N{\rEng}Oh, my God. Your body is a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:17.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你紧张吗？\N{\rEng}Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 有点\N{\rEng}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但也很开心吧？\N{\rEng}Oh, but are you glad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:25.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 是呀 挺好的\N{\rEng}Yeah, yes. It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:26.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,显然这是我想要的\N{\rEng}Like, I wanted it, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,费了好大劲\N{\rEng}Like, we tried a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 你确实想要\N{\rEng}Yeah. You did want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 利迪\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Lydie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,打算用我的名字吗？\N{\rEng}Are you gonna name it Agnes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\rEng}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 我不知道 我不确定\N{\rEng}Yeah. I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别急着拒绝\N{\rEng}Try and think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:10:00.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,捐的精子质量肯定不错\N{\rEng}So it must have been good sperm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊 幸好如此\N{\rEng}Yeah. Thank God for that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:05.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,某个高个儿白人的好精子\N{\rEng}random, tall white guy's good sperm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:11.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要不我也用他的生个孩子\N{\rEng}Maybe I should have his babies too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:13.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,正好当兄弟\N{\rEng}and then they can be brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都是匿名的\N{\rEng}Well, he's pretty hard to track down, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:20.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有照片嘛 能把他找出来\N{\rEng}Well, we have his picture, so we could look him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:28.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,能摸摸吗？\N{\rEng}Can I touch it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:31.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:38.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都感觉不到\N{\rEng}I don't really feel anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:40.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,因为还没长成个小宝宝\N{\rEng}That's because it's not like a baby yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:42.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,多大了？\N{\rEng}How old is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:44.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有十周吧\N{\rEng}Ten weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:46.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以估计挺小的\N{\rEng}So probably really small.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.84,0:10:47.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:49.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,像老鼠那么大？\N{\rEng}What, like a mouse maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.63,0:10:52.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,老鼠有多大来着？\N{\rEng}How big is a mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 比那还小\N{\rEng}Oh, it's smaller than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:58.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哇 竟然比老鼠小\N{\rEng}Wow, smaller than a mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:05.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,今晚可别跟任何人提这个\N{\rEng}Don't tell anyone tonight about...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\rEng}Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.14,0:11:08.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我从不乱说秘密\N{\rEng}I never tell secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:10.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,除非我真想讲\N{\rEng}unless I feel it is a secret I really wanna tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这话听着一点也不让人放心 宝贝\N{\rEng}That is not reassuring, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.91,0:11:14.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我真不想去\N{\rEng}I don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:15.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\rEng}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.74,0:11:18.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不行 得去 不然娜塔莎会把我宰了\N{\rEng}No, we have to. Natasha will kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:21.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得 她给人感觉态度不好\N{\rEng}I feel like... I feel like she's, like, rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:22.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,说话带刺\N{\rEng}like, tonally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:24.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是 她讲话可刺人了\N{\rEng}Oh, she definitely has a very rude tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:25.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\rEng}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:27.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,她说话语气真有问题\N{\rEng}She's got a really rude tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:31.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你怕吗？\N{\rEng}Are you afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:34.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有点\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:36.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是怕疼吗？\N{\rEng}For the pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:40.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但这是个独立的人啊\N{\rEng}But also because it's like, a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我想养出个好人\N{\rEng}I wanna make a really good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你会把孩子带成好人的\N{\rEng}You're gonna make a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:49.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,会疼得要命的\N{\rEng}It's gonna hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是 会疼死你的\N{\rEng}Oh, my God, it seems like it hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 别这么说\N{\rEng}No! Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:54.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我能说\N{\rEng}I'm allowed to say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:55.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不许你说\N{\rEng}you're not allowed to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:58.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,废话不说\N{\rEng}Blah, blah, blah. Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:00.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,简而言之 房子买到了\N{\rEng}Short story is, we got the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但花的比我们预期多得多\N{\rEng}but we had to pay, like, significantly more than we wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,喜欢这房子吧？我家的！\N{\rEng}Do you like this house? My house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:09.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 挺喜欢的\N{\rEng}I, I do. Yeah. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,木头 好有质感\N{\rEng}The wood... it's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,高档的 很奢华\N{\rEng}It's rich. Like dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:14.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.05,0:12:16.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,准备搬哪些东西来？\N{\rEng}What are you gonna put in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 这房子？ - 对\N{\rEng}- In our house? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:19.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 那沙发\N{\rEng}Uh... our couch,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那床\N{\rEng}our bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:22.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,本尼父母给她的五斗柜\N{\rEng}Benny's parents' dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么都搬来\N{\rEng}All your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:24.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\rEng}Yes. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.81,0:12:25.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,果然\N{\rEng}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你现在真的长大了\N{\rEng}You're like a fully fledged adult now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,大伙儿 我们有多久没聚了？\N{\rEng}Guys, how long has it been since, like, we've hung out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:33.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,见面只能尴尬来句...\N{\rEng}I'm just sort of like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:34.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:36.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们毕业有三年了吧？\N{\rEng}Is it three years since we graduated?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:37.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 四年了吧 - 哦 都四年了吗\N{\rEng}- Four, I think. - Oh, my God, is it four years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:38.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.77,0:12:40.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,时光飞逝啊\N{\rEng}Time really does fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.45,0:12:41.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,时光真飞逝啊\N{\rEng}Time really does fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:44.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不过 对我和安尼丝大概不算\N{\rEng}But not for me or Agnes probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:47.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们还待在学校里\N{\rEng}since we're still here, still at the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你还待在那房子里\N{\rEng}You're still at your same house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:50.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那破房子里\N{\rEng}That little house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:53.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就你们三个走出去的会觉得飞逝\N{\rEng}But time probably flies for the three of you who left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:55.99,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 去纽约啦 - 嗯 对 纽约\N{\rEng}- New York. - Yeah, yeah. New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\rEng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:58.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,替你高兴\N{\rEng}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:00.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 回来这趟感触挺深\N{\rEng}Um, but it's a trip being back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,去安尼丝家路上路过学校\N{\rEng}I drove past the campus on my way to Agnes',
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:06.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,见到图书馆就起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\rEng}and I just got, like, full body chills when I saw the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那图书馆 利迪 别提了\N{\rEng}The library. Lydie, no. please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你懂吧\N{\rEng}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:12.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那地方给我留着很深的压力印记\N{\rEng}I have, like, deeply ingrained stress from that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:15.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 在研究院那会儿真太狠了\N{\rEng}Yeah, Grad school was wild. I honestly feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我写那论文跟长征一样\N{\rEng}I worked on that thesis for like, a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:20.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛 有次我在图书馆自习室\N{\rEng}Yeah. This one time, um...on the third floor in a private room,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:23.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,差点想用《小杜丽》那书把脸划破\N{\rEng}I almost paper cut my face open with my copy of Little Dorrit
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:26.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好去医院里睡个安稳觉\N{\rEng}just so I could go to the hospital and have a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:29.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没真做 但闪过那念头\N{\rEng}I didn't do it, but I thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 有时我做噩梦\N{\rEng}Yeah, sometimes I have nightmares
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:36.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,梦到我论文全变白纸 我还把它吃了\N{\rEng}where my thesis is like all blank pages, and then I eat the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:38.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐 那好可悲\N{\rEng}Oh, my God, that's so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:40.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊 可不是嘛 真的挺可悲的\N{\rEng}Yeah. It is really sad, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:44.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那么 安尼丝 你就过得顺风顺水了？\N{\rEng}So, Agnes, it was really that easy for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不想谈谈什么事情吗？\N{\rEng}No story? Nothing to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:49.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那事儿可不是安尼丝的错 是德克尔太粘她\N{\rEng}Well, it's not Agnes' fault that Decker liked her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:52.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 不是她的错 说来我都生气\N{\rEng}No, it wasn't her fault,  but, um, it pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:14:00.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这鱼做的不错 里面放了什么？\N{\rEng}This fish is amazing. What's... what's in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:01.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼啊\N{\rEng}Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩近况如何？\N{\rEng}Uh... well, how is it, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都是老师了\N{\rEng}You're the teachers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我还没有转正\N{\rEng}I am still part time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:10.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不过下学期会让我带一门课吧\N{\rEng}but I think I'm gonna teach a class next semester...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:13.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还没正式说 但挺有戏\N{\rEng}which they haven't said is what's gonna happen, but it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:15.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 挺有戏 - 不 是一定会\N{\rEng}- Yeah, it could. - No. It will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 对 一定会\N{\rEng}Yeah. Yes. It, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们英语系这边还有新情况\N{\rEng}Well, we have news in the English department.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:21.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 该你的大新闻了\N{\rEng}Agnes? Agnes has big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.66,0:14:23.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,去下洗手间 抱歉\N{\rEng}Bathroom. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:27.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝已转正 占了威尔金森留的位置\N{\rEng}Agnes is now a full-time teacher. She took Wilkinson's spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:29.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是接手了 那位置\N{\rEng}Filled the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:32.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝真厉害 这么年轻就转正了\N{\rEng}Agnes is like super young to be full-time faculty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:35.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 五十年来最年轻的 靠腿上位的\N{\rEng}Yeah, she's like the youngest in fifty years, that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.30,0:14:36.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,开玩笑啦\N{\rEng}I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没去干净\N{\rEng}There's a bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:47.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼刺没去干净\N{\rEng}In the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:52.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你这鱼没剔干净 里面还有根鱼刺\N{\rEng}There's, like, a bone in the fish that you served me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:56.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:57.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没事 没事\N{\rEng}No, it's... it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,下次你招待客人\N{\rEng}It's just like maybe you should, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:03.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,把鱼刺处理好 注意点礼数\N{\rEng}debone it a little bit better before you serve it to people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你好呀 我的猫宝贝\N{\rEng}Hello, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:16.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我的猫宝贝\N{\rEng}Oh, you're a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,妈妈爱你 妈妈爱你\N{\rEng}I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:19.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,噢 要下去吗？\N{\rEng}Oh, you wanna get down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:21.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 把你放下去\N{\rEng}Okay. I'll put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你会走出这房子吧？\N{\rEng}You leave the house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 天天走出啊\N{\rEng}Yeah. I leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,得去上班 我有工作的 利迪\N{\rEng}I go to work. I have a job, Lydie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:34.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但...\N{\rEng}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你还待在那间办公室里啊\N{\rEng}you're still in the same office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:39.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,的确\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:43.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 你说过你会换办公室的\N{\rEng}Agnes, you said that you were gonna switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:48.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我 我可不想被迫解释为什么换\N{\rEng}Well, I...I didn't wanna have to explain why it's weird for me to be in that office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:51.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,编个理由 说墙发霉之类的\N{\rEng}Maybe you should say there's mold or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:52.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\rEng}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:56.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,该死 要我举报说墙里有死动物发臭吗？\N{\rEng}Do you want me to call them and say there's a dead animal in the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:59.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你真是大好人 但不用\N{\rEng}You are an angel from heaven, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚转正\N{\rEng}It's like, I just got the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我都不知道我配不配得上这位子\N{\rEng}I don't even know if I should have the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:05.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 别这样\N{\rEng}Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:10.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想嫌我的办公室\N{\rEng}I don't wanna complain about my office,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:13.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,空间大 采光又好\N{\rEng}which is technically huge, and there's a lot of light,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:18.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我能明白他为什么喜欢这间\N{\rEng}and I can see why he liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,总之 是的 我决定走出去这房子\N{\rEng}Anyways, yes, I leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:27.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝...\N{\rEng}Agnes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别...\N{\rEng}don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,去死\N{\rEng}die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:35.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会死的\N{\rEng}I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要真打算自尽\N{\rEng}If I was gonna kill myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:42.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我早在去年做了\N{\rEng}I would have done it like last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,或者在前年\N{\rEng}or the year before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 肯定在前年\N{\rEng}Ugh. Or, like, definitely the year before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:48.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 别\N{\rEng}Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会死的\N{\rEng}No. I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.27,0:16:55.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那我也回敬你一句\N{\rEng}Let me return the sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你也别想着去死\N{\rEng}You please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.12,0:17:04.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪...\N{\rEng}Lydie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:07.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你怀了个小宝宝\N{\rEng}You're having a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:10.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:15.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你会把宝宝照顾得很好\N{\rEng}You're gonna take such good care of your little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:18.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会死的\N{\rEng}I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:19.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,求你别死\N{\rEng}Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 我求你\N{\rEng}No, you please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.78,0:17:28.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想跟宝宝打个招呼吗？\N{\rEng}Do you wanna say hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.50,0:17:40.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我是安尼丝\N{\rEng}I'm Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:44.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我是你妈咪\N{\rEng}I'm your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:48.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪和弗兰可能会有别的说法 但听我说\N{\rEng}Lydie and Fran may tell you otherwise, but heed my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:49.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 我是你妈 - 安尼丝！\N{\rEng}- I'm your mother. - Agnes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:51.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 别闹 正经点 - 好 好吧\N{\rEng}- Do it properly. - Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是安尼丝\N{\rEng}Hi. I'm Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:17:59.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是你妈咪\N{\rEng}I'm not your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是你妈咪\N{\rEng}I am your mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.69,0:18:06.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哎 真受不了你\N{\rEng}Oh, for goodness sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得宝宝踢我了\N{\rEng}I felt it kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:08.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有 你没有\N{\rEng}No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.08,0:18:14.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那包...多谢\N{\rEng}Are you gonna... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别走\N{\rEng}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,来\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我很快就来看你\N{\rEng}I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:22.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么时候？\N{\rEng}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,来纽约吧\N{\rEng}Come to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我有空床\N{\rEng}I've got an extra bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,跟弗兰说我讨厌TA\N{\rEng}Tell Fran that I hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:29.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,才不\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:30.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 其实不讨厌TA\N{\rEng}No, I don't hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:32.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道 宝贝\N{\rEng}I know, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:35.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 爱你 - 也爱你\N{\rEng}- Love you. - Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:40.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 等下\N{\rEng}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.09,0:18:46.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,快点回来哦\N{\rEng}Come soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:47.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是因为...\N{\rEng}Not because of, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.93,0:18:50.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是因为我要去死之类的 只是...\N{\rEng}not because I'm gonna kill myself, but just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:51.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只是...\N{\rEng}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:54.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别拖那么久才回来\N{\rEng}don't wait so long to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:57.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.08,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:45.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:46.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,靠！\N{\rEng}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:47.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\rEng}What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:49.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么了？ - 靠！天呐！\N{\rEng}- What's happening? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:51.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我受够学校了！\N{\rEng}I hate school!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,学校真把人逼疯了！\N{\rEng}School fucking sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:54.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我脑袋像着了火\N{\rEng}My brain feels like it's on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:56.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,像快要死了一样！\N{\rEng}Like I'm gonna fucking die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我才发现 宝贝\N{\rEng}I just realized, babe,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:02.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没人会在乎泰德·休斯\N{\rEng}no one gives a fuck about Ted Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:04.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不对 大家都挺在乎泰德·休斯的\N{\rEng}No, everyone cares about Ted Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:05.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我不相信\N{\rEng}No, no, no. I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:08.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我花了两年研究那男人\N{\rEng}I spent two years writing about a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,现在和男人上床我都不睁眼\N{\rEng}I don't even fuck guys with my eyes open anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:12.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只想闭眼想女人\N{\rEng}I just close my eyes and imagine women.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:16.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要展开说说吗？\N{\rEng}Do you wanna talk about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:19.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,说什么？\N{\rEng}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\rEng}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:42.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好了 我来了 抱歉 来晚了\N{\rEng}Okay, I'm here. Sorry, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:44.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都写完了吗？\N{\rEng}Did we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.61,0:21:45.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,勉强\N{\rEng}Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 德文 你呢？ - 我做完了\N{\rEng}- Devin? - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.81,0:21:53.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉各位 我平时不爱拖延\N{\rEng}I am so sorry. I don't really procrastinate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:56.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是故意抢先的\N{\rEng}so this wasn't like a whole thing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\rEng}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.04,0:22:00.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别太谦虚 真金藏不住的\N{\rEng}Keep showing off, it'll get you places.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪\N{\rEng}Lydie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:04.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我在这儿\N{\rEng}I'm Lydie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:06.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你写好了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you finish?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 是的 嗯...\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.23,0:22:10.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 是这样的\N{\rEng}Yeah, but the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:12.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别生气 确实写完了\N{\rEng}like, don't be mad. I did finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:15.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只是最后一页是从...\N{\rEng}The last page is, like, a copy and paste extract of...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.24,0:22:21.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,从《向伯利恒跋涉》复制来的 不是我写的\N{\rEng}"Slouching Towards Bethlehem" that I didn't write.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:25.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 抄耶茨还是狄迪恩？ - 是狄迪恩\N{\rEng}- Yates or Didion? - Didion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:27.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,当然是狄迪恩\N{\rEng}Always Didion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:29.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯...你看\N{\rEng}Uh... Hey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.33,0:22:32.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我是你的导师 帮手 之类的\N{\rEng}I'm supposed to be your mentor, helper, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.33,0:22:34.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,来这是帮你按时交论文的\N{\rEng}I'm just here to make sure it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:36.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我的写完了\N{\rEng}I did mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:40.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行 好 不错 娜塔莎\N{\rEng}Okay. Good. That's... that's great, Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:45.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪 周三前能搞定吗？\N{\rEng}Lydie, you think you can finish by Wednesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.39,0:22:47.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,去掉狄迪恩的稿子给我\N{\rEng}Get me your draft minus the Joan by then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 行吧\N{\rEng}Yeah, again...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.18,0:22:50.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉打断\N{\rEng}Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.17,0:22:51.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要看我的吗？\N{\rEng}Are you gonna read mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:54.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要啊 职责所在嘛\N{\rEng}Of course. That's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:56.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你还要问安尼丝她交了吗？\N{\rEng}Are you gonna ask Agnes if she did hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:22:59.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:01.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝...\N{\rEng}Agnes...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.99,0:23:04.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,进展如何？\N{\rEng}How'd yours go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:07.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,挺好 做完了\N{\rEng}Fine. I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.02,0:23:09.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,等不及想看了\N{\rEng}Can't wait to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:11.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你也会想看我那份吧？\N{\rEng}But you're gonna read mine too though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:14.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,会的\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:28.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么还在写这东西？\N{\rEng}Why am I still working on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:30.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你还没写完\N{\rEng}Because you didn't finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:31.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别介意\N{\rEng}No offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:33.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别显摆了\N{\rEng}Stop bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:34.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我又没显摆\N{\rEng}I'm not bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:37.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你腿翘在墙上呢\N{\rEng}Your legs are on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:39.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\N{\rEng}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.07,0:23:40.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我也写完了\N{\rEng}Well, if I'd finished it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.44,0:23:42.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我腿也会翘上墙的\N{\rEng}my legs would be on the wall too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:43.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可我还没写完\N{\rEng}but I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:46.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我没翘着\N{\rEng}So, my legs aren't on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:48.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行 我把腿放下\N{\rEng}Okay. I will take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.41,0:24:08.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,又怎么了？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:12.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该跟他上床\N{\rEng}You should fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:14.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想跟他上床\N{\rEng}I don't wanna fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 真的\N{\rEng}- Really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.01,0:24:18.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那如果你不想 就千万别做\N{\rEng}Well, if you don't wanna fuck him, definitely don't fuck him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:19.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\rEng}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.82,0:24:23.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得他想上你\N{\rEng}I think he wants to fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.31,0:24:24.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:25.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.55,0:24:28.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 这可不妙\N{\rEng}Well, that sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:29.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:34.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他老夸我聪明是图这个吗？\N{\rEng}Do you think that's why he's telling me I'm smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:37.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 我觉得他夸你因为你真很聪明\N{\rEng}No, I think he's telling you you're smart because you're really smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.80,0:24:38.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:44.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你会怎么回他...\N{\rEng}What would you say though...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.56,0:24:46.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他开口要你跟他睡？\N{\rEng}if he asked you to fuck him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:47.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我会说不的\N{\rEng}I would say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他要开口 我会生气的\N{\rEng}I would be upset if he asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\rEng}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.35,0:24:56.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\rEng}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.27,0:24:59.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我会当面说 不...\N{\rEng}I would say no...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.77,0:25:02.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不过 谢谢你\N{\rEng}but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.48,0:25:10.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,请进\N{\rEng}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.91,0:25:13.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.94,0:25:15.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 你好\N{\rEng}Agnes, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:18.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你见我\N{\rEng}Thanks for meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:19.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也谢谢你来见我\N{\rEng}Thanks for meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.50,0:25:21.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,手头挺忙的？\N{\rEng}Are you working on something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:22.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我是说...\N{\rEng}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:26.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有 没什么\N{\rEng}No. Not, not...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.89,0:25:29.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么特别的\N{\rEng}not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:32.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 你得交代清楚\N{\rEng}Well, now you have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.93,0:25:34.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:36.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我已经知道不少了\N{\rEng}Because now I know too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.85,0:25:41.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 行 好吧\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah, okay. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.98,0:25:45.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我在写本书\N{\rEng}I'm writing a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.23,0:25:47.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 书？ - 嗯\N{\rEng}- A book? - A book.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.86,0:25:49.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,大部头吗？\N{\rEng}A long book?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.10,0:25:51.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 中等长度 - 挺好\N{\rEng}- Medium. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:53.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,为啥？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.24,0:25:55.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,长篇就那样 说得太透\N{\rEng}Well, long is like... okay, we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.53,0:25:56.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 短篇则...\N{\rEng}Right. And short is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.84,0:25:58.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,像雾里看花\N{\rEng}Why did you even write a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.08,0:26:04.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 我写的这中篇则...\N{\rEng}Yeah, well, even though this is medium...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.51,0:26:06.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 正好合适 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- The perfect length. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.09,0:26:10.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这书烂透了 看见它我都想上吊\N{\rEng}I have to say it is horrible, and every time I look at it, I wanna kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.66,0:26:15.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就需要坏书来衬托\N{\rEng}Well, there actually have to be books like that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:19.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好书才能更显珍贵\N{\rEng}so that we can distinguish which books are really the good books.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.26,0:26:20.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.69,0:26:25.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这破书也算是为社会做贡献了\N{\rEng}I'm doing a public service by writing a shit book.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:27.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rEng}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.23,0:26:29.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这样安慰你吧\N{\rEng}if it helps at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:32.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢你第一本小说的\N{\rEng}I liked your first novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,它烂得独特\N{\rEng}I liked how fucked up it was and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.07,0:26:36.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,让我觉得活着有意义\N{\rEng}how it made me feel like there's a reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.42,0:26:39.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哪怕我看不清那理由\N{\rEng}even if I can't see it, that I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.79,0:26:41.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,读起来不像小说\N{\rEng}And it didn't feel like fiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.25,0:26:43.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是那种做作的虚构\N{\rEng}which I think is a compliment in this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.61,0:26:47.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我 我做别的事时常想起它\N{\rEng}And...I think about it all the time when I'm doing other stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.88,0:26:51.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,吃冰淇时 望窗外时\N{\rEng}like eating ice cream or looking out the window.
