Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.60,0:42:29.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 是的\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.61,0:42:31.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,现在感觉安全吗？\N{\rEng}Do you feel safe now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.95,0:42:34.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉 开始前 额...我得说\N{\rEng}Sorry, before... uh, we do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.86,0:42:37.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我可光着呢\N{\rEng}I just want you to know that I'm fully naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.99,0:42:41.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 啥？ - 是病号服下面光着 行吗？\N{\rEng}- What? - Under the robe. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.36,0:42:42.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可以 没问题\N{\rEng}Yeah. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.46,0:42:47.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 介意让下吗？ - 好 行\N{\rEng}- Do you mind? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.32,0:42:51.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 什么时候的事儿？\N{\rEng}So, when did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.82,0:42:53.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那件事？\N{\rEng}The thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.40,0:42:54.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你受害\N{\rEng}The assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.60,0:42:55.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,昨天晚上\N{\rEng}Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.52,0:42:56.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,昨天下午\N{\rEng}Last evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.70,0:42:57.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,昨天傍晚\N{\rEng}Yesterday evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.81,0:43:00.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 事后有洗澡吗？ - 洗了\N{\rEng}- And have you showered? - I took a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:02.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这种事最好...\N{\rEng}So it's usually best to go to the emergency room
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.23,0:43:04.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,事发后马上来急诊\N{\rEng}right after something like this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.25,0:43:07.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行 下回记住了\N{\rEng}Oh, okay. I will definitely keep that in mind for the next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.50,0:43:10.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,在急诊室会用性侵取证包\N{\rEng}Well, that's when we would use a sexual assault forensic evidence kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.59,0:43:13.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,打断下 麻烦您换个说法\N{\rEng}Oh, okay. I feel like you just need to...tonally shift away from the tone
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.53,0:43:15.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,换个语气\N{\rEng}you're taking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.40,0:43:17.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,温和点那种\N{\rEng}Like, we just need a tonal shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.27,0:43:22.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就想检查有没有被传到什么 通过阴道的那种\N{\rEng}Just wanna make sure he didn't give me anything, like, vaginally or yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.29,0:43:25.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,施暴者在你体内射精了吗？\N{\rEng}Did your attacker ejaculate in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.74,0:43:28.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,额 我不太想叫他施暴者\N{\rEng}Um, well, I wouldn't call him my attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.92,0:43:29.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是 啪 那种\N{\rEng}It wasn't like, bah!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.99,0:43:32.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你可被强奸了啊\N{\rEng}But you were raped.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.02,0:43:33.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 哎呦喂 - 是 无言以对\N{\rEng}- Whoa. - Yeah. And well put.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.83,0:43:37.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我理解你说不出口\N{\rEng}I know this is hard to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:39.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不像是您真理解了啊\N{\rEng}It doesn't feel that you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.34,0:43:41.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没办法 得按流程里的问\N{\rEng}These questions are protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.06,0:43:43.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 但您问TA的方式真尖锐啊\N{\rEng}Yeah, you're asking them in a really freaky way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.27,0:43:44.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,冷静点 女士\N{\rEng}Calm down, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.30,0:43:46.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 她很冷静 - 我可冷了\N{\rEng}- Oh, she's calm. - I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.07,0:43:47.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,继续问吧\N{\rEng}You can finish your questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.44,0:43:49.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他有没有在你体内射精？\N{\rEng}Did he ejaculate in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.65,0:43:51.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真能问啊\N{\rEng}Horrible word.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.45,0:43:55.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没 他进来的时间不长 就像...\N{\rEng}No, the actual him being inside me part wasn't that long, it was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.62,0:44:00.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 那几下 - 好\N{\rEng}- that long. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.27,0:44:04.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,接下来抽个血 查怀孕\N{\rEng}So, we'll do a blood test to check you for pregnancy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.29,0:44:07.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,查性病感染\N{\rEng}and sexually transmitted infections,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.38,0:44:10.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,再来个宫颈培养\N{\rEng}and then we'll do a cervix culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.20,0:44:12.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 好享受啊 - 说啥？\N{\rEng}- Yum. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.95,0:44:14.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,她说好享受啊\N{\rEng}She said yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.36,0:44:16.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我马上回来 马上开始\N{\rEng}I'll be right back, and we can get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.11,0:44:27.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 安尼丝 - 嗯哼\N{\rEng}- Agnes? - Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.05,0:44:30.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\rEng}He's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.57,0:44:31.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\rEng}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.12,0:44:35.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,德克尔搬走了\N{\rEng}Decker's transferring.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.32,0:44:38.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他在纽约上州找了个工作\N{\rEng}He got a job in New York. Upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:40.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\rEng}He's leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.82,0:44:47.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:50.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么鬼？\N{\rEng}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.89,0:44:54.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是好事吗？\N{\rEng}Is this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.62,0:44:55.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.47,0:44:58.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也许 说不准\N{\rEng}Maybe. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.76,0:45:02.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他跟你提过要走吗？\N{\rEng}Did he say anything about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.81,0:45:03.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.83,0:45:10.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,昨天他桌上和平常一样乱\N{\rEng}And yesterday his desk was, like, really cluttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.57,0:45:13.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不像要搬家的样子\N{\rEng}Like he wasn't packed or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.34,0:45:16.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以他跑路了\N{\rEng}So he's running.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.84,0:45:20.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,挨千刀的\N{\rEng}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.35,0:46:29.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是... - 是安尼丝吧\N{\rEng}- Hi, I'm... - Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:31.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你好 我叫伊丽莎白 这位是克莱尔\N{\rEng}Hi, I'm Elizabeth. This is Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.79,0:46:33.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是克莱尔 - 幸会\N{\rEng}- Hi, Agnes. I'm Claire. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.97,0:46:36.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,能麻烦你跟我们来一下吗？\N{\rEng}Do you mind coming back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.05,0:46:37.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行\N{\rEng}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.35,0:46:45.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,很抱歉发生了这种事\N{\rEng}We are so sorry to hear this happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.81,0:46:47.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会...\N{\rEng}We are taking this
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.14,0:46:50.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,认真严肃处理的\N{\rEng}really seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.60,0:46:59.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么处理？\N{\rEng}Are you gonna do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:02.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们会展开调查\N{\rEng}We would begin an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.50,0:47:04.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只是你可能听说了\N{\rEng}But as you may have heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.18,0:47:07.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他昨天递交了辞呈 在...\N{\rEng}he sent in his letter of resignation yesterday at...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:09.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,昨天下午4:18分\N{\rEng}4:18 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.92,0:47:14.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,而你是在今天早上8:42分才报告的\N{\rEng}And you reported this today at 8:42 am.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.33,0:47:16.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.60,0:47:20.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,遗憾地是 他已经离职\N{\rEng}Unfortunately, he's no longer under our employ.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.12,0:47:23.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,因此无法实施\N{\rEng}So we can't take the measures that we would normally take
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.05,0:47:26.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,停职 解雇之类的处分\N{\rEng}such as suspending him or letting him go or...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.71,0:47:28.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,无能为力\N{\rEng}things of that nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.45,0:47:31.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这件事真不好办\N{\rEng}These things are really hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.62,0:47:34.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,很遗憾大学这边\N{\rEng}and the University is unfortunately unable
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.71,0:47:37.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,无法承担任何责任\N{\rEng}to take any kind of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.10,0:47:40.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可他是我的导师啊\N{\rEng}But he was my advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.71,0:47:44.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,前任 导师\N{\rEng}Former advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.26,0:47:51.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,建议你去警局报案\N{\rEng}You have the option of going to the police station and reporting this
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.05,0:47:54.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,让他们发逮捕令\N{\rEng}and issuing an arrest warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:03.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们对此感同身受\N{\rEng}We know what you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.58,0:48:06.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们也是女性\N{\rEng}We are women.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.07,0:48:10.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.70,0:48:16.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们也是女性\N{\rEng}We are women.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.64,0:49:15.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.59,0:49:18.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.07,0:49:21.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你是我邻居吧？\N{\rEng}You're my neighbor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.43,0:49:23.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 我住这儿\N{\rEng}Yeah, I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:24.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你叫什么？\N{\rEng}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.43,0:49:26.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 呃 盖文\N{\rEng}Oh, uh, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.06,0:49:27.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文 幸会\N{\rEng}Gavin, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.70,0:49:29.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 彼此彼此 - 我是安尼丝\N{\rEng}- You too. - I'm Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.57,0:49:32.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,圣经里的羔羊\N{\rEng}Lamb of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.74,0:49:34.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 算了\N{\rEng}- What? - That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.29,0:49:37.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么 我就是 呃...\N{\rEng}It's all good, I'm just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.34,0:49:39.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你今晚忙啥？\N{\rEng}What are you up to this fine evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.29,0:49:44.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 你有能点火的东西吗？\N{\rEng}Oh, I was wondering, do you have, like, stuff that makes a fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.11,0:49:45.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 呃...\N{\rEng}Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.29,0:49:48.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,火柴吗？\N{\rEng}Matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.40,0:49:50.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是 要那种助燃液 有吧\N{\rEng}No, like a liquid. Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.84,0:49:52.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有的\N{\rEng}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.05,0:49:54.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 烧烤助燃油 - 对 有吗？\N{\rEng}- Lighter fluid. - Yes. Do you have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.44,0:49:55.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.65,0:49:58.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,用来干嘛？\N{\rEng}Why do you need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.09,0:50:00.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 我跟一帮朋友要做烤肠\N{\rEng}Um, my friends and I, we're gonna make, like, hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.88,0:50:03.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 我也喜欢吃烤肠\N{\rEng}Oh, hot dog sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:06.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉 只买了两根\N{\rEng}Oh, I'm sorry, we only bought two hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.36,0:50:10.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 不 没关系 我...我跟我妈吃\N{\rEng}Oh, no, that's no problem, I'm...I have dinner plans with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.55,0:50:11.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\rEng}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.69,0:50:13.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我怕被拒\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, I just wanted to close myself off
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:15.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,才装作有事的\N{\rEng}from the possibility of being rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.37,0:50:18.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\rEng}That's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.05,0:50:21.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 我去拿助燃油 - 好\N{\rEng}- I'll get the lighter fluid. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.67,0:50:23.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,屋里暖和 进来坐坐？\N{\rEng}Do you wanna come inside while I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.25,0:50:25.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,算了 想在这儿等 行吗？\N{\rEng}Uh, no, sorry. Can I wait outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.46,0:50:28.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行 没问题 我马上给你\N{\rEng}Yeah. Don't worry about it. Um, I'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.97,0:50:42.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这该够用\N{\rEng}This should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.61,0:50:44.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了 谢谢\N{\rEng}Great, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.79,0:50:49.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,倒在要烧的东西上 就行了吧？\N{\rEng}And so do I just pour this on the thing I want to be on fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.48,0:50:52.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,烧什么 烧烤吗？\N{\rEng}On the barbecue?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.79,0:50:53.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.82,0:50:57.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 嗯 别倒太多\N{\rEng}Uh, yeah, don't put too much of it on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.41,0:50:59.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.88,0:51:01.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要 要我帮忙吗？\N{\rEng}Do you... do you want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.00,0:51:03.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不用\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.81,0:51:06.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你...\N{\rEng}Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.32,0:51:07.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是盖文\N{\rEng}Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.22,0:51:11.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 盖文 真谢谢你 盖文\N{\rEng}Gavin. Yes. Thank you, definitely, Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.86,0:51:15.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你不是住那边吗？\N{\rEng}Uh, don't you live over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.59,0:51:18.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,啥 哦 对 确实是 哈哈\N{\rEng}Ha! Yup, I... yup, definitely. Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.12,0:51:50.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,从哪儿弄的？\N{\rEng}Why do you have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.39,0:51:52.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,找邻居要的\N{\rEng}I got it from the neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.46,0:51:54.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,干嘛要？\N{\rEng}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.96,0:51:58.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,肯定不是正常人会有的想法\N{\rEng}It's definitely not, like, a good or normal train of thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.05,0:52:00.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.02,0:52:04.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来想把德克尔办公室烧掉\N{\rEng}I think I was gonna light Decker's office on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.99,0:52:10.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.24,0:52:14.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你真想这么做吗\N{\rEng}Do you still wanna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.28,0:52:16.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没想好\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.09,0:52:22.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那我来做\N{\rEng}I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.78,0:52:26.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你真好\N{\rEng}That's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.96,0:52:29.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但不用\N{\rEng}But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.21,0:52:32.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,认真说 要是你想烧他办公室\N{\rEng}No, seriously. If you need someone to burn his office down,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.84,0:52:36.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,又不想自己去 我替你做\N{\rEng}but you don't wanna do it yourself, I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:39.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 我甚至不想咒他死\N{\rEng}No, I don't even want him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.62,0:52:41.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我想\N{\rEng}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.68,0:52:44.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想他死\N{\rEng}I don't want him to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.18,0:52:48.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 改主意了就告诉我\N{\rEng}Well, if you change your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.68,0:52:50.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.71,0:52:55.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也许一起烧点小的\N{\rEng}Maybe we could burn something smaller,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.11,0:52:58.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他头发或他笔之类的\N{\rEng}like his hair or his pens or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.77,0:53:00.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我会考虑的\N{\rEng}I'll think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.70,0:53:02.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.12,0:53:10.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哎 还得去做烤肠\N{\rEng}I have to make hot dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.16,0:53:11.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,为嘛？\N{\rEng}Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.39,0:53:15.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟邻居编了大谎 不烤心里过不去\N{\rEng}I told the neighbor, it's like this whole big lie. I'm stuck in a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.89,0:53:17.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 我来做\N{\rEng}Okay. I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.97,0:53:19.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:22.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没事 我本想砍个人 相比这小菜一碟\N{\rEng}No, it's fine. I was gonna, like, kill a man, so this is much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.96,0:53:26.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,家里有烤肠吗？\N{\rEng}Do we have hot dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.24,0:53:29.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.64,0:54:44.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.19,0:54:53.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 我要去买咖啡\N{\rEng}Okay. I'm going to get coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.70,0:54:59.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我能抱你吗？\N{\rEng}Do you want me to pick you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.97,0:55:11.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\rEng}Well, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.57,0:55:14.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太美好了\N{\rEng}This is really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.43,0:55:17.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我想...\N{\rEng}I guess um...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.73,0:55:21.08,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 我爱你\N{\rEng}Yup. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.72,0:55:28.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,愿意陪我买咖啡吗？\N{\rEng}You wanna come get coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.98,0:55:30.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,三文鱼罐头？\N{\rEng}Salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.48,0:55:35.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 挺挑食的 有品位\N{\rEng}All right, you're picky, an excellent quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.57,0:55:36.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,金枪鱼的？\N{\rEng}Tuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.98,0:55:41.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可能隔着罐头闻不出来\N{\rEng}Maybe you're just smelling the can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.34,0:55:43.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,里面是金枪鱼\N{\rEng}There's tuna inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.79,0:55:46.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 各买一罐\N{\rEng}All right, one of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.47,0:56:03.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.60,0:56:06.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就这些吗？\N{\rEng}Is this all for you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.04,0:56:07.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是的 麻烦了\N{\rEng}Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.53,0:56:15.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你带猫进来了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you bring a cat into the grocery store?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.21,0:56:17.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有啦\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.45,0:56:20.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就有\N{\rEng}Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.61,0:56:22.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,信号不好 说啥？\N{\rEng}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.60,0:56:24.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你骗人\N{\rEng}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.36,0:56:25.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 才没呢\N{\rEng}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.83,0:56:36.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您的猫粮 谢谢惠顾\N{\rEng}Here's your cat food.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.17,0:56:40.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,咖啡没了\N{\rEng}We ran out of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.58,0:56:42.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我买了\N{\rEng}I got some.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.17,0:56:45.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我捡了只猫\N{\rEng}I got a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:52.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,挺你啦\N{\rEng}Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.59,0:59:25.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家来履行陪审员传召\N{\rEng}Thank you for being here and completing your summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.54,0:59:30.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还没填的 不清楚流程的\N{\rEng}For those of you who haven't done this and don't know what to expect,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.29,0:59:35.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,请上前来领问卷表\N{\rEng}please come up and get a questionnaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.26,0:59:40.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,填好交回来\N{\rEng}Fill it out and return it to us completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.52,0:59:49.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要用笔的话 请来拿\N{\rEng}We have little pencils if you need a little pencil.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.23,1:00:17.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,以下人员免除陪审义务\N{\rEng}The following jurors are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.18,1:00:20.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,陪审员 1号 3号 5号\N{\rEng}Juror one, three, five,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.76,1:00:23.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,7号 8号\N{\rEng}seven, eight,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.02,1:00:26.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,30号 32号\N{\rEng}30, 32,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.03,1:00:29.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,39号 25号\N{\rEng}39, 25,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:32.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,42号 43号\N{\rEng}42, 43,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.49,1:00:35.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,49号 59号\N{\rEng}49, 59.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.21,1:00:37.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你们免除义务\N{\rEng}You are dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.51,1:00:40.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢 你们可以离庭了\N{\rEng}Thank you. You can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.66,1:00:44.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,富勒女士 通过刚才讲解\N{\rEng}And do you think, Mrs. Fuller, based on that definition,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.39,1:00:47.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您明白“排除合理怀疑”意思吗？\N{\rEng}you understand the meaning of beyond a reasonable doubt?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:48.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.63,1:00:50.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要达到不怀疑的标准\N{\rEng}That to be convinced beyond a shadow of a doubt,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.69,1:00:53.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,在案发时非得亲眼见到吗？\N{\rEng}you must have been there and seen the crime with your own eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.53,1:00:54.99,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不用 明白\N{\rEng}Yes. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.01,1:00:56.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都能以\N{\rEng}And do the rest of you feel
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.38,1:01:00.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- “排除合理怀疑”作为评判依据吗？ - 是\N{\rEng}- you can apply that idea, beyond a reasonable doubt, to this case? - Mhmm
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.75,1:01:03.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有多少人是父母？\N{\rEng}How many of you have children?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.64,1:01:06.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,沃瓜德先生 有孩子？\N{\rEng}Uh, Mr. Woguard. You have a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.60,1:01:09.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 是 索菲刚满四岁\N{\rEng}Uh, yes. Soph just turned four.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.40,1:01:11.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,假设您女儿在公园\N{\rEng}Say you and your daughter were at the park
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.32,1:01:12.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,玩攀爬架\N{\rEng}and she's playing on the monkey bars.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.83,1:01:14.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您有几分钟没看她\N{\rEng}And you turned your back for a few minutes,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.75,1:01:17.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,她跑过来说胳膊伤了\N{\rEng}and then she runs over to you with a broken arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.70,1:01:19.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您怎么判断？\N{\rEng}What would you think happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.11,1:01:21.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,她从攀爬架上掉下来摔的\N{\rEng}She fell off the monkey bars and broke her arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.41,1:01:24.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 这就是间接证据的例子\N{\rEng}Yes, so that's an example of circumstantial evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.79,1:01:28.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,根据事实可以做出的合理推断\N{\rEng}That's what you can reasonably infer based on the facts that you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.61,1:01:30.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,沃瓜德先生 能明白吗\N{\rEng}Does this make sense, Mr. Woguard?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.68,1:01:31.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.92,1:01:34.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是有其他孩子跑来告诉您\N{\rEng}And if instead another child ran over to you
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.54,1:01:37.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,说看见她怎么摔的\N{\rEng}and told you he saw her fall off the monkey bars,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.97,1:01:41.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有人目击 这就是直接证词\N{\rEng}that's direct testimony because someone witnessed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.89,1:01:44.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,大家能明白\N{\rEng}Does everybody understand that difference,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.31,1:01:47.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,间接证据和直接证词的区别吗？\N{\rEng}between circumstantial evidence and direct testimony?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.91,1:01:49.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,能\N{\rEng}Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.27,1:01:50.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有直接证词\N{\rEng}Without direct testimony,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.73,1:01:54.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能肯定犯罪一定发生\N{\rEng}we cannot be positively certain a crime has been committed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.63,1:01:56.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,作为检方\N{\rEng}As the prosecution,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.07,1:01:59.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我得把罪证明到排除合理怀疑\N{\rEng}I must prove the defendant's guilt beyond a reasonable doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.74,1:02:03.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,即 从现有的证据中\N{\rEng}Meaning, that there is no other reasonable explanation
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.08,1:02:05.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不存在其他合理解释\N{\rEng}that can come from evidence presented.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.50,1:02:08.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谁是犯罪受害者\N{\rEng}If any of you have been victims of a crime,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.05,1:02:09.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,请举手\N{\rEng}please raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.71,1:02:13.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,费伯先生 您遭遇了什么？\N{\rEng}Uh, Mr. Faber, what was the crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.48,1:02:15.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我被抢劫了 持枪的\N{\rEng}Uh, I was robbed. At gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.59,1:02:16.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您认为\N{\rEng}Do you have any reason to believe
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.27,1:02:18.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那次遭遇会妨碍您\N{\rEng}that experience would make you unable to serve
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.78,1:02:21.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,担任此庭公正陪审员吗？\N{\rEng}as an impartial juror on this trial?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.30,1:02:22.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不会\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.07,1:02:25.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,沃德小姐\N{\rEng}Miss Ward.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.66,1:02:27.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.52,1:02:29.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,刚问到受害者时\N{\rEng}When I asked who has been a victim of a crime,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.57,1:02:30.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,您举手了吧？\N{\rEng}did you raise your hand?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.85,1:02:34.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不是的 我不能讲这件事 就...\N{\rEng}No, I realized I shouldn't share it. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.86,1:02:38.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不能讲受害经历？\N{\rEng}You're unable to share the crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.23,1:02:43.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这样说吧 大庭广众说出来那事儿\N{\rEng}It is frankly my worst nightmare to have to tell this whole room of strangers
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.78,1:02:45.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是我最害怕的\N{\rEng}about the thing that happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.72,1:02:46.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以...\N{\rEng}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.95,1:02:50.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我才把手\N{\rEng}that is the reasoning as to why I did not decide
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:52.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,又放下来了\N{\rEng}to continue having my hand raised.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.83,1:02:54.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,见谅\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.69,1:02:58.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那次遭遇会妨碍您\N{\rEng}Do you think the crime would make you unable to serve
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.71,1:03:01.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,担任此庭公正陪审员吗？\N{\rEng}as an impartial juror on this case?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.22,1:03:05.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,问得好 我一直在想这个\N{\rEng}That is a good question, and one I've been thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.47,1:03:08.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想出结论了吗？\N{\rEng}Have you come to any conclusions?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.77,1:03:12.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得 退出陪审团更合适\N{\rEng}You know, I think I would be better not being on the jury
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.81,1:03:15.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,做别的事情为社会做贡献\N{\rEng}and instead would do better fulfilling a different civic role.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.00,1:03:19.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么别的事情？\N{\rEng}And what kind of civic role do you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.23,1:03:23.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你问 我是个教授\N{\rEng}So, thank you for asking. I am actually a professor,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.03,1:03:26.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还没转正 期待早日实现\N{\rEng}part-time, hopefully soon full-time,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.95,1:03:28.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,教书很重要\N{\rEng}which, teaching is important work.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.91,1:03:31.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,教学是很有意义的\N{\rEng}I think teaching is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.15,1:03:35.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有人说教师是最合适的陪审员\N{\rEng}Some would say that a teacher makes an ideal juror.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.32,1:03:37.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是呢 不\N{\rEng}Absolutely not, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.59,1:03:39.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你的问卷表上写着...\N{\rEng}On your questionnaire, you wrote...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.42,1:03:40.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 别 别\N{\rEng}Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.51,1:03:43.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我没想到会被当众念出来\N{\rEng}I did not know that we would be reading those aloud, so.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.41,1:03:45.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,“你朋友怎样形容你”\N{\rEng}"How would your friends describe you?"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.33,1:03:49.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,“聪明”被划掉了 改成了个“高”\N{\rEng}"Smart." Crossed out, then the word "tall."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.01,1:03:56.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是那遭遇让你有偏见 就会免除你\N{\rEng}If the crime you were a victim of makes you biased, we will dismiss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.23,1:03:59.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,说了不会惹上事吧？\N{\rEng}Can I get in trouble for telling you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.82,1:04:02.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你是受害者 怎会有事？\N{\rEng}Why would you get in trouble if you were the victim?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.18,1:04:03.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\rEng}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.49,1:04:06.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,法律有很多不讲理的地方\N{\rEng}The law makes no sense in my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:12.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那...\N{\rEng}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.92,1:04:19.13,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那事我从未公开说过\N{\rEng}I haven't said it out loud actually before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.16,1:04:20.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\rEng}Well, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.90,1:04:22.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你报警了吗？\N{\rEng}Did you go to the police?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.47,1:04:24.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.76,1:04:27.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,物证只有个扣子\N{\rEng}All I had was a button,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.36,1:04:30.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不想见他坐牢\N{\rEng}and I don't want him to go to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.47,1:04:31.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\rEng}Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.02,1:04:36.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他有个孩子\N{\rEng}He has a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.60,1:04:45.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我希望给他个机会改过\N{\rEng}I want him to stop being someone who does that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.20,1:04:47.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是进了监狱\N{\rEng}And if he went to jail,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.56,1:04:51.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他就永远被定义成那种人了\N{\rEng}he'd just be someone who does that, who's now in jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.01,1:05:01.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,法官阁下 我可以上前吗？\N{\rEng}Your honor, may I approach the bench?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.07,1:05:11.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝·沃德 获准离庭\N{\rEng}Agnes Ward, you are excused.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.52,1:05:14.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.06,1:05:19.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,书记员 请传下一位陪审员\N{\rEng}Clerk, you may call the next juror.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.66,1:05:22.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 现在叫...\N{\rEng}Okay. We'll now call up...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.21,1:05:27.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,雷克斯·哈伯曼\N{\rEng}Rex Haberman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.03,1:05:30.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗？\N{\rEng}Rex?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.21,1:05:37.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.73,1:06:26.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,刚才满意吗？\N{\rEng}Did you have a good time?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.01,1:06:28.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.17,1:06:30.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你满意刚才的那个吗？\N{\rEng}Did you like the sex we just had?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.02,1:06:32.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯\N{\rEng}Mhmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.93,1:06:34.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.60,1:06:36.64,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.02,1:06:40.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.74,1:06:42.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.11,1:07:06.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 你带的讨论课\N{\rEng}Agnes, we've gotten incredibly positive feedback
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.55,1:07:08.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,学生反馈非常好\N{\rEng}from the students in your discussion section
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.41,1:07:11.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,作为兼职教师你很受欢迎\N{\rEng}about your part-time contribution to this university.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.88,1:07:17.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不管是现任教师 还是前任 都在夸你\N{\rEng}From current faculty, former faculty, it's just all glowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.86,1:07:20.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 还有前任？ - 有\N{\rEng}- Former faculty? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.07,1:07:23.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,大家都这样形容你...\N{\rEng}You've been called, let's see,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.76,1:07:25.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,乐于助人\N{\rEng}helpful,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.48,1:07:27.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,无微不至\N{\rEng}supportive,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.55,1:07:29.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还有 出类拔萃\N{\rEng}extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.81,1:07:31.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,一直在讨论谁来接手\N{\rEng}We know there's been talk about the open spot here
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.74,1:07:34.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,普雷斯顿·德克尔离职后的空位\N{\rEng}since Preston left, we haven't...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.14,1:07:37.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,得找个最合适的接手人\N{\rEng}well, we wanted to find the right fit for the program.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.16,1:07:40.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,很高兴 费尔波特这儿\N{\rEng}And we are thrilled to finally offer you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.70,1:07:44.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,终于要请你做全职教师了\N{\rEng}a full-time teaching position here at Fairport.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.14,1:07:45.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\rEng}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.21,1:07:46.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真的 真的\N{\rEng}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.59,1:07:49.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,系里一致同意的\N{\rEng}The department voted unanimously.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.35,1:07:52.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哇 我接受\N{\rEng}Wow. I accept.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.60,1:07:53.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.97,1:07:57.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你来教入门课 二十世纪小说\N{\rEng}You'll teach our introductory course, "The Twentieth Century Novel,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.51,1:07:59.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你已经带过几回了\N{\rEng}which you've led a few times,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.68,1:08:02.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还可以自己开一门选修课\N{\rEng}and you'll also create your own elective.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.17,1:08:03.96,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们很想请你\N{\rEng}We would love for you to consider
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.98,1:08:06.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,开一门短篇小说赏析课\N{\rEng}teaching a class on the art of the short story
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.71,1:08:11.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都读过你那论文 写得很吸引人\N{\rEng}since we all read your thesis and frankly found that fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.56,1:08:12.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.40,1:08:14.49,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想教别的也行\N{\rEng}Or if there's another course you'd rather teach, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.51,1:08:15.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 不是 只是...\N{\rEng}No, no, it's just I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.82,1:08:19.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,发表后我就没碰过它 但我会再看的\N{\rEng}I haven't looked at my thesis since I published it, but I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.28,1:08:23.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,看完后给你拟一份教学大纲\N{\rEng}I can...I can look through it, and I will create a syllabus for you to look at.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.24,1:08:24.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.22,1:08:27.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴你能来任教\N{\rEng}We're thrilled to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.23,1:08:31.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.01,1:08:37.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 跟你说件事\N{\rEng}Agnes, I have to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.47,1:08:40.35,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我坠入爱河了\N{\rEng}I am in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.37,1:08:42.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是呀 - 天呐\N{\rEng}- What? - Yeah! - What!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.68,1:08:46.06,4Chi,,0,0,0,,超级 超级女同的那种爱\N{\rEng}And like, super, super gay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.09,1:08:47.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,远超咱们想象\N{\rEng}Like, gayer than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.56,1:08:48.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 哇哦\N{\rEng}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.89,1:08:50.30,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐 是那位吗？\N{\rEng}Oh, my God. With that person?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.32,1:08:51.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 对 弗兰 - 好\N{\rEng}- Yeah. Fran. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.86,1:08:53.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 厉害\N{\rEng}- Yeah. - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.36,1:08:57.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,做女同又被爱 超幸福吧？\N{\rEng}Wow. Okay, are you so happy being gay and in love?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.26,1:09:02.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,幸福死了 做女同又被爱超棒\N{\rEng}Oh, I'm like really, really happy being gay and in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.43,1:09:04.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐 你得见见TA！\N{\rEng}Oh, my God, you have to meet them!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.12,1:09:06.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 我绝对想见\N{\rEng}Yeah, I totally do. I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.05,1:09:12.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 利迪 你值得永远 永远被爱\N{\rEng}You...Oh, Lydie, you deserve to be in love all the time forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.78,1:09:14.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 宝贝\N{\rEng}Thank you, babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.23,1:09:17.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对 对了 我拿到职位了\N{\rEng}Well, well... so I got the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.38,1:09:18.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.17,1:09:19.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚转正\N{\rEng}I got the full-time position.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.95,1:09:21.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.30,1:09:22.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真假的？安尼丝\N{\rEng}What? Agnes!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.72,1:09:25.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真的 但没坠入爱河那么棒\N{\rEng}Yeah, well, it's, it's...not as good as being in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.31,1:09:27.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是呢 这超棒的\N{\rEng}Yes it is. This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.22,1:09:28.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\rEng}This is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.64,1:09:29.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我的安尼丝\N{\rEng}Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.88,1:09:32.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行吧 也挺棒\N{\rEng}Yeah, no, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.64,1:09:36.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真的 真的是你应得的 安尼丝\N{\rEng}You really, really earned this, Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.59,1:09:46.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是你的办公室了\N{\rEng}And here is your office.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.54,1:09:48.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有需要随时找我\N{\rEng}Let me know if you need anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.71,1:09:50.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,像灯泡坏了这类 随时找我\N{\rEng}if a light bulb goes out, anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.08,1:09:52.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 索菲 - 嗯\N{\rEng}- Thanks, Sophie. - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.74,1:10:29.08,4Chi,,0,0,0,,“当我的身体像活塞般起伏时\N{\rEng}"And it struck me, as my automaton knees went up and down
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.08,1:10:32.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我才发现对小尤物的内心一无所知\N{\rEng}that I simply did not know a thing about my darling's mind
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.91,1:10:39.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也许她稚嫩的想法背后\N{\rEng}and that quite possibly behind the awful, juvenile cliches...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.09,1:10:45.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有花园 暮色与城堡的大门\N{\rEng}there was in her a garden and a twilight and a palace gate,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.48,1:10:48.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那朦胧可爱的心境\N{\rEng}dim and adorable regions which happened to be
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.70,1:10:50.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,却对我心门紧闭...”\N{\rEng}lucidly and absolutely forbidden..."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.81,1:10:52.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,沃德教授\N{\rEng}Professor Ward.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.17,1:10:53.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,说\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:57.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我觉得这书真很恶心\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, but I personally found this book really disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.57,1:11:01.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,听男人这么说真宽慰\N{\rEng}Well, Jeremy, there's a world in which that's a relief to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.78,1:11:04.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那文笔呢？\N{\rEng}How did you find the writing itself?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.21,1:11:08.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这 这就是矛盾的地方\N{\rEng}Well, that's the thing is I...I felt pissed off because I...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.20,1:11:09.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我讨厌情节本身\N{\rEng}really hated the stuff happening
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.58,1:11:12.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但又喜欢他的文笔\N{\rEng}but I really liked the sort of stuff he was saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.84,1:11:15.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 又爱又恨 - 嗯 没事\N{\rEng}- So I was pissed. - Mmm, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.13,1:11:18.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,谁还有同感\N{\rEng}Was anyone else feeling that way caught between the form,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.21,1:11:21.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,被手法和内容搞得矛盾？\N{\rEng}the presentation itself, and the content of that presentation?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.88,1:11:26.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 教授 那女士又来了\N{\rEng}Uh, professor... that lady is back
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.95,1:11:30.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,又从小窗往这儿看\N{\rEng}looking through the little window thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.11,1:11:37.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,她很执着\N{\rEng}She is persistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.22,1:11:42.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,像亨伯特想把洛丽塔永远锁在青春里\N{\rEng}Much like Humbert's desire to freeze Lolita in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.65,1:11:45.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 说得好 - 好 继续读\N{\rEng}- Nice. - Okay. Let's read.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.72,1:11:49.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,“我常常发现 我们俩生活在一个\N{\rEng}"For I often noticed that living as we did,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:53.51,4Chi,,0,0,0,,完全邪恶的世界里”\N{\rEng}she and I, in a world of total evil..."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.64,1:12:06.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 听说... - 嗨\N{\rEng}- So... - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.65,1:12:09.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪订婚了\N{\rEng}Lydie got engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.56,1:12:10.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.07,1:12:12.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,什么时候办婚礼？\N{\rEng}When's the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.44,1:12:14.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,夏天办\N{\rEng}It's in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.39,1:12:17.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢弗兰吗？ - 挺喜欢的\N{\rEng}- Do you like Fran? - Oh, yeah. Fran is nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.37,1:12:21.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有点腼腆 善良 个子还高\N{\rEng}Reserved, kind of. Really tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.11,1:12:27.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你想说什么？\N{\rEng}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.20,1:12:29.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,听说你转了正职\N{\rEng}So you got the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.94,1:12:32.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.53,1:12:37.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我也想要这职位\N{\rEng}I wanted the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.08,1:12:38.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.46,1:12:41.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 就不觉得自己做错了吗？ - 有错\N{\rEng}- Do you feel bad at all? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.09,1:12:43.88,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但不是我 是别人的\N{\rEng}But, for other reasons, not because of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.92,1:12:46.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对你来说顺风顺水\N{\rEng}Okay, well, um...just because things come easy to you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.72,1:12:48.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不代表你能抢\N{\rEng}doesn't mean that you get to take things from people
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.25,1:12:49.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别人难得的机会\N{\rEng}who things don't come easy to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.63,1:12:51.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我活得可不轻松\N{\rEng}Things don't come easy to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.03,1:12:53.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就轻松 大家都喜欢你\N{\rEng}Yes they do. Everyone likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.14,1:12:54.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 又聪明又性感 - 谢谢\N{\rEng}- You're smart, you're hot. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.88,1:12:56.22,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 是有魅力\N{\rEng}Ew, not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.25,1:12:57.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,洛根喜欢你 德文喜欢你\N{\rEng}Logan likes you, Devin likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.94,1:12:59.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,利迪喜欢你\N{\rEng}Lydie likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.56,1:13:01.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,德克尔也喜欢你\N{\rEng}Decker likes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:06.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可你并不喜欢我\N{\rEng}Well, you don't like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.08,1:13:16.54,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是\N{\rEng}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.52,1:13:18.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还真是\N{\rEng}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.18,1:13:27.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,仔细想来\N{\rEng}You know, when I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.51,1:13:30.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,德克尔其实恨我\N{\rEng}I think Decker actually hated me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.74,1:13:33.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他最偏心的就是你 你竟敢这么说\N{\rEng}You were his chosen one. That's a completely insane thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.45,1:13:37.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不对 因为当你被喜欢\N{\rEng}No. Because when you like someone or, like,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.59,1:13:40.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,或被尊重时\N{\rEng}when you respect someone,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:45.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,人们会尊重你的意愿\N{\rEng}there are some ways people treat you that are one way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.35,1:13:47.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,尊重你的感受\N{\rEng}Respectful, and like,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.30,1:13:52.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,把你当成有血有肉 有独立思考的人\N{\rEng}you're a person who lives and breathes and thinks for them self.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.06,1:13:58.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但也有不顾你感受的人\N{\rEng}And then some ways people treat you are not that way,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.21,1:14:00.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,而那很可恶\N{\rEng}and they're bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.42,1:14:07.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 我和他上过床\N{\rEng}All right. Well, um, I fucked him...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.59,1:14:09.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,结果他连当面\N{\rEng}and, uh, he didn't even take the time
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:12.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,给我论文批注都懒得做 所以嘛\N{\rEng}to give me in-person notes on my thesis. So...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.96,1:14:15.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你跟他睡过？\N{\rEng}You fucked him?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.81,1:14:16.81,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.76,1:14:20.42,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是你同意的吗？\N{\rEng}Did you want that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.44,1:14:21.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,同意什么？\N{\rEng}Want what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.02,1:14:27.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是你主动的吗？\N{\rEng}Was it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.20,1:14:28.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,主动的 咋了\N{\rEng}Yes, it was on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.95,1:14:34.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,就五分钟 挺一般 我玩过更好的\N{\rEng}We had, like, five minute sex. It was just okay. I've had better.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.68,1:15:11.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们打烊了 这儿不能停车\N{\rEng}We're closed. You can't park here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.15,1:15:15.28,4Chi,,0,0,0,,糟了 糟了\N{\rEng}Oh, shit. Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.31,1:15:18.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不该冲你吼\N{\rEng}Look, I'm sorry I yelled at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.73,1:15:22.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我儿子汉克也会这样喘 有时很严重\N{\rEng}My kid, Hank, gets these breathing attacks too, real bad sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.33,1:15:25.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道你在害怕\N{\rEng}I know you're scared,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.38,1:15:28.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但你已离开车道了 在车里\N{\rEng}but you're off the road, you're in your car,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.21,1:15:29.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你很安全\N{\rEng}and you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.88,1:15:33.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我来带你呼吸 你跟我学 好吗？\N{\rEng}I'm gonna breathe and you breathe with me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.17,1:15:33.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,跟上节奏\N{\rEng}You just follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.97,1:15:36.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 准备好 吸...\N{\rEng}All right? You ready? In...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.12,1:15:41.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呼 二 三 四 五\N{\rEng}Out... two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.20,1:15:42.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,吸...\N{\rEng}In...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.19,1:15:47.69,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呼 二 三 四 五\N{\rEng}Out... two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.74,1:15:49.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,吸...\N{\rEng}In...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.22,1:15:54.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呼 二 三 四 五\N{\rEng}Out... two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.45,1:15:57.65,4Chi,,0,0,0,,吸 二 三 四 五\N{\rEng}In... two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.68,1:16:01.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呼 二 三 四 五\N{\rEng}Out... Two, three, four, five.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.83,1:16:08.07,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真心说 我平时不这么呼吸 但感觉不错\N{\rEng}I gotta be honest, I don't really breathe like that, but it feels good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.13,1:16:09.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,还好吧？\N{\rEng}You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.14,1:16:11.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,干得好\N{\rEng}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.84,1:16:15.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想吃个三明治吗？\N{\rEng}You want a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.02,1:16:26.01,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我本想摆这儿几张桌子\N{\rEng}I wanted to put tables out here, so,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:28.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,至少有地方坐着吃\N{\rEng}people, you know, wouldn't sit on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.38,1:16:31.68,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这三明治配得上好地方\N{\rEng}It's a good sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.71,1:16:32.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不该坐在\N{\rEng}You shouldn't eat a good sandwich
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.94,1:16:35.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都是鸟屎的地上吃\N{\rEng}while you're sitting on the ground where the pigeons shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:36.71,4Chi,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\rEng}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.97,1:16:40.79,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他们说 这停车场和垃圾场共用\N{\rEng}But they said, you share a...a parking lot with the guys at the dump.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.82,1:16:42.82,4Chi,,0,0,0,,得那帮人同意\N{\rEng}So you gotta ask the guys at the dump.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.84,1:16:45.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不找你们那帮垃圾！\N{\rEng}No fucking way I'm asking the guys at the dump!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.79,1:16:46.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你才垃圾呢\N{\rEng}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.68,1:16:50.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,一帮垃圾\N{\rEng}Fucking assholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.57,1:16:53.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真好吃\N{\rEng}This is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.34,1:16:55.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 当然好\N{\rEng}Yeah, of course it's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.30,1:17:00.16,4Chi,,0,0,0,,没有金刚钻哪敢开个店\N{\rEng}You don't have a sandwich shop, you don't make a good sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.64,1:17:01.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,辣辣的\N{\rEng}Spicy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.64,1:17:04.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,意大利进口辣椒 挺贵的\N{\rEng}Yeah, calabrian chili, very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.28,1:17:07.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝\N{\rEng}Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.39,1:17:09.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,啥？\N{\rEng}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.03,1:17:12.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 叫“安你死”？ - 对\N{\rEng}- Agnes? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.99,1:17:14.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,难听\N{\rEng}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.47,1:17:17.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哎呦 你和那帮人一样坏啊\N{\rEng}Whoa, you sound like the mean guys from the dump.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.65,1:17:20.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,喂 我不同意\N{\rEng}Hey! I res... I resent that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.68,1:17:25.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那帮人才是垃圾 我说话直 心不坏\N{\rEng}Those guys are assholes. I'm honest, not an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.05,1:17:27.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你有个儿子？\N{\rEng}You have a son?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.96,1:17:29.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他也是垃圾\N{\rEng}He's an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.17,1:17:31.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,叫汉克\N{\rEng}Hank.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.80,1:17:35.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 汉克嘛... - 难听\N{\rEng}- Hank is... - Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.13,1:17:37.03,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不用跟我解释\N{\rEng}You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.05,1:17:39.56,4Chi,改0917,0,0,0,,听起来像“憨克”\N{\rEng}Sounds too much like the word honk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.03,1:17:42.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 你有孩子吗？ - 绝不\N{\rEng}- You have kids? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.28,1:17:45.70,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不想要吗？\N{\rEng}Want some?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.82,1:17:50.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,啊 我想象不到自己老了啥样\N{\rEng}Uh... Well, I can't really imagine myself old.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.49,1:17:52.91,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你以为我能料到变成这样？\N{\rEng}You think I imagined myself like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.86,1:17:55.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 说实话\N{\rEng}No, believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.82,1:18:00.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我真没料到自己会变成有嘴的山药\N{\rEng}I did not think I would end up looking like a yam with a mouth on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.45,1:18:03.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,现实就这样\N{\rEng}But here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.95,1:18:06.17,4Chi,,0,0,0,,该来的总会来\N{\rEng}It'll happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.83,1:18:08.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你根本料不到\N{\rEng}You won't know what hit you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.62,1:18:15.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我就碰上一桩噩事\N{\rEng}Something pretty bad happened to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.92,1:18:18.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,因此才有点不正常呢\N{\rEng}so that's probably why I'm acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.93,1:18:21.40,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有多糟？\N{\rEng}How bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:25.38,4Chi,,0,0,0,,算很糟吧\N{\rEng}I guess really bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.18,1:18:28.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你自己不觉得糟吗？\N{\rEng}You don't know it's bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.14,1:18:33.21,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 我知道那很糟\N{\rEng}No, I know it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.53,1:18:37.84,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只是每次跟人提\N{\rEng}But mainly because whenever I tell anyone about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.22,1:18:40.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,他们都大惊小怪\N{\rEng}they look really scared for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:44.46,4Chi,,0,0,0,,除了我那朋友 但她搬走了\N{\rEng}Except for my friend, but she moved away.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.96,1:18:47.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我一回想就难受\N{\rEng}And then sometimes I feel bad when I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.34,1:18:49.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有时...\N{\rEng}because...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.79,1:18:53.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,会浮现一些瞬间\N{\rEng}I remember moments of it,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.06,1:18:58.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,然后身体会有强烈的\N{\rEng}and I can feel in my body
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.25,1:19:01.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,排斥反应\N{\rEng}that it was really bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.30,1:19:06.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有时我完全不去想 挺怪的\N{\rEng}But then sometimes I don't think about it, which is weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.72,1:19:12.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不想就内疚 像背叛那段痛\N{\rEng}And I feel guilty when I don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.92,1:19:15.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,刚发生的吗？\N{\rEng}Did it just happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.06,1:19:17.26,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你才喘成那样？\N{\rEng}Is that why you were huffing and puffing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.31,1:19:20.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 是三年...\N{\rEng}No, it was three...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.13,1:19:22.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是三年多前了\N{\rEng}a little over three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.99,1:19:24.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧 不算太久\N{\rEng}Well, that's not that much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.34,1:19:29.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,严格说 也不短了 但也不太长\N{\rEng}I mean, it's a lot of time, but it's not that much time, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.29,1:19:32.59,4Chi,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.58,1:19:37.75,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你...\N{\rEng}Are you...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.61,1:19:41.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,家里有人陪你吗？\N{\rEng}okay in your house?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.11,1:19:44.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我有只猫\N{\rEng}I have a cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.39,1:19:46.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.36,1:20:05.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,奥宝 别闹\N{\rEng}Olga, what the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.36,1:20:07.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,奥宝 抓紧睡觉\N{\rEng}Olga, go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.99,1:20:11.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,呃 奥宝 你在我床上便便了？\N{\rEng}Ugh, Olga, did you shit in my bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.09,1:20:16.10,4Chi,,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\rEng}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.42,1:20:19.53,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦！奥宝 你搞什么啊？\N{\rEng}Oh! Olga, what the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.38,1:20:21.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.76,1:20:25.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想杀就别留它口气啊\N{\rEng}Oh, if you wanted to kill it, you should have just killed it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.76,1:20:27.99,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 我这就来 这就来\N{\rEng}Okay. I'm coming back. I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.01,1:20:30.43,4Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就来 怎么办 怎么办\N{\rEng}It'll be over soon. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.52,1:20:34.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么办 需要什么？得找什么来着？\N{\rEng}Okay. What do I need? What am I looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.92,1:20:39.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦！袋子 袋子 找到个袋子\N{\rEng}Oh! A bag, a bag! I got a bag!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.11,1:20:40.48,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\rEng}I'm coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.40,1:20:46.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,回来了 我回来了 真对不起\N{\rEng}I'm back, I'm back, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.74,1:20:47.72,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\rEng}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.74,1:20:50.20,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不 不是说你 你快死了\N{\rEng}No, no you're not, you're dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.89,1:20:53.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,进袋子\N{\rEng}Get in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.54,1:20:55.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,快进去\N{\rEng}Just go in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.79,1:20:58.27,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起了\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.18,1:21:13.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起了\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.10,1:21:20.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 天呐\N{\rEng}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.11,1:21:36.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文！\N{\rEng}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.07,1:21:39.67,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文！\N{\rEng}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.72,1:21:41.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,盖文！\N{\rEng}Gavin!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.68,1:21:43.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝 没事吧？\N{\rEng}Agnes, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.84,1:21:46.87,4Chi,,0,0,0,,安尼丝？呃...\N{\rEng}Agnes? What...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.29,1:21:49.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\rEng}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.68,1:21:53.44,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你能来上我吗？\N{\rEng}Will you come fuck me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.45,1:21:55.74,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.06,1:21:57.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,等等 我得穿鞋\N{\rEng}Wait, wait. I need shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.10,1:22:03.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我呃...真得穿鞋\N{\rEng}I um... I do need shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.44,1:22:06.09,4Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\rEng}One second.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.98,1:23:26.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 嘿\N{\rEng}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.25,1:23:27.25,4Chi,,0,0,0,,可以进去小便吗？\N{\rEng}Can I pee?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.27,1:23:28.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 来吧\N{\rEng}Oh, yeah. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.51,1:23:56.37,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我能进去吗？\N{\rEng}Can I get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.83,1:23:58.05,4Chi,,0,0,0,,哦 进来泡？\N{\rEng}Oh, in the bath?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.07,1:23:59.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.32,1:24:01.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 行啊\N{\rEng}Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:12.41,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我转身换衣\N{\rEng}I'm just gonna turn around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.43,1:24:13.66,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你别看\N{\rEng}Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.41,1:24:16.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不用藏着掖着\N{\rEng}You don't have to hide it.
