Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.84,1:25:27.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,等下 我能看看吗？\N{\rEng}Oh, wait. Can I look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.90,1:25:29.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,小弟弟？\N{\rEng}At my dick?
