Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.70,1:25:43.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真没见过这么软的\N{\rEng}I've never seen one that soft.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.98,1:25:47.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊 十年的噩梦从此开始\N{\rEng}Okay, I think that just gave me nightmares for the next decade.
