Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.18,1:26:06.00,4Chi,,0,0,0,,好 看完了\N{\rEng}Okay, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.77,1:26:30.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你想要那种大家都有的事情吗？\N{\rEng}Do you think you want the stuff that everyone has?
