Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.91,1:26:49.92,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯 我想要那种事情\N{\rEng}Yeah. I want that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.01,1:26:52.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\rEng}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.37,1:26:54.50,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\rEng}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.20,1:26:57.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯...\N{\rEng}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.87,1:27:02.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,只想让利迪住近点\N{\rEng}You know, probably just to keep Lydie closer...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.17,1:27:05.80,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但我看不见\N{\rEng}but I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.83,1:27:09.19,4Chi,,0,0,0,,看什么？\N{\rEng}See it where?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.21,1:27:11.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,看不见那种未来\N{\rEng}Like, in my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.25,1:27:16.63,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我看不见自己变老 看不见有孩子\N{\rEng}I don't see myself getting older or having kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.10,1:27:19.57,4Chi,,0,0,0,,也看不见自己\N{\rEng}I don't see myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.80,1:27:22.98,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你会是个好妈妈的\N{\rEng}I think you'd be a great mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.76,1:27:25.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\rEng}Why?
