Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.36,1:27:40.95,4Chi,,0,0,0,,人们开始都说不要孩子\N{\rEng}People always say they don't want a kid,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.06,1:27:43.55,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但想法最终会变\N{\rEng}but then things change.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:47.14,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我们想要的事情...\N{\rEng}What we want and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.32,1:27:49.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,最终会变的\N{\rEng}I think it changes.
