Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.60,1:28:45.56,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\rEng}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.79,1:28:48.02,4Chi,,0,0,0,,- 我想死你了 - 我也想死你了\N{\rEng}- I missed you. - I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.05,1:28:50.52,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我太想你了 天呐\N{\rEng}I missed you so much. Oh, my God.
