Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.16,1:33:19.23,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.11,1:33:21.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我是安尼丝\N{\rEng}I'm Agnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.29,1:33:29.24,4Chi,,0,0,0,,真神奇 最终你会长成个独立的人\N{\rEng}Pretty weird you're gonna be a person someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.26,1:33:31.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别介意 你现在真有点吓人\N{\rEng}No offense, but you look insane right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.63,1:33:34.45,4Chi,,0,0,0,,光溜溜 头发很少\N{\rEng}Skin and just a small amount of hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.74,1:33:37.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\rEng}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.14,1:33:39.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,很快会变样的\N{\rEng}It won't be like that in a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.03,1:33:48.86,4Chi,,0,0,0,,能抱抱你吗？\N{\rEng}Is this okay or...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.55,1:34:03.76,4Chi,,0,0,0,,行\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.91,1:34:06.47,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不抱了\N{\rEng}I'll put you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.50,1:34:08.62,4Chi,,0,0,0,,想要啊 那就再抱起来\N{\rEng}Oh. I'll pick you back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.64,1:34:10.15,4Chi,,0,0,0,,抱了 抱了 抱了\N{\rEng}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.28,1:34:36.89,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你长得真漂亮\N{\rEng}You're so sweet looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.24,1:34:56.94,4Chi,,0,0,0,,等你长大后 不管什么想法...\N{\rEng}When you grow up, you can tell me whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.84,1:35:02.73,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都可以告诉我 哪怕是个坏念头\N{\rEng}Like, if you have a thought and you're like, that's a bad thought,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.89,1:35:08.31,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我很可能也有过 而且更坏\N{\rEng}I probably had that same thought but, like, ten times worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.23,1:35:12.61,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你尽管说\N{\rEng}So you can just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.26,1:35:16.34,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会大惊小怪的\N{\rEng}I'll never be scared by that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.74,1:35:24.12,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是有人对你做了桩噩事...\N{\rEng}If someone does something bad to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.22,1:35:27.58,4Chi,,0,0,0,,有人借此闲言碎语 冷嘲热讽...\N{\rEng}If someone says something scary...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.18,1:35:34.77,4Chi,,0,0,0,,让你想用铅笔 刀之类的东西自尽\N{\rEng}If you wanna kill yourself with like a pencil or a knife or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.50,1:35:38.90,4Chi,,0,0,0,,都可以跟我说\N{\rEng}you can just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.76,1:35:46.33,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我永远不会评头论足 大惊小怪\N{\rEng}I'll never tell you you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.37,1:35:49.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,我只会说 嗯 我知道...\N{\rEng}I'll just say, yeah. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.72,1:35:53.85,4Chi,,0,0,0,,事情有时就这样\N{\rEng}It's just like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.88,1:35:54.97,4Chi,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.65,1:35:59.83,4Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.86,1:36:03.60,4Chi,,0,0,0,,坏事可能会找上你\N{\rEng}that bad things are gonna happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.82,1:36:07.99,4Chi,,0,0,0,,希望不会\N{\rEng}I hope they don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.30,1:36:11.78,4Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我能阻止 一定要跟我说\N{\rEng}If I can ever stop something from being bad, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.44,1:36:17.93,4Chi,,0,0,0,,坏事不会给你打招呼\N{\rEng}But sometimes bad stuff just happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.49,1:36:23.04,4Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我有点心疼你\N{\rEng}That's why I feel bad for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.07,1:36:24.32,4Chi,,0,0,0,,某种程度上\N{\rEng}in a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.09,1:36:32.36,4Chi,,0,0,0,,你活着却还体会不到\N{\rEng}That you're alive and you don't know that yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.82,1:36:42.18,4Chi,,0,0,0,,但我还是能静心聆听的\N{\rEng}But I can still listen
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.20,1:36:44.39,4Chi,,0,0,0,,不会大惊小怪\N{\rEng}and not be scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.67,1:36:50.29,4Chi,,0,0,0,,这很好\N{\rEng}So that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.04,1:36:55.11,4Chi,,0,0,0,,至少是点儿安慰\N{\rEng}Or that's something, at least.
